-- 054-company-data-seed.sql
-- One-time hand-curated seed of company profile facts (industry/size/headquarters/
-- description/website) for crawler.company rows left empty by the automatic
-- LLM-enrichment pipeline (#354/ADR 0026), which never ran successfully - see #484
-- (crawler-service called its own container instead of job-service, 404 on every
-- scheduled run). Rather than fix that wiring, #484 removes the automatic scheduler;
-- company data going forward comes from this curated seed plus the existing admin
-- manual-edit UI (story #430/#461).
--
-- Values researched and verified against each company's own site / Wikipedia /
-- LinkedIn company page. source='manual' + manually_edited=true mirrors exactly what
-- UpdateCompanyUseCase sets on an admin edit (CompanyPanacheRepository.java:134),
-- so these rows are excluded from the (now-removed) pending-enrichment query and from
-- any future automated overwrite, identically to an admin having edited them by hand.
--
-- Idempotent: safe to re-run, only touches rows that still look untouched
-- (industry IS NULL AND manually_edited = false) so a real admin edit made between
-- deploys is never clobbered.

BEGIN;

